WHAT THIS SHOWS: an AdminCap's validity is on-chain state. Granting and revoking a
cap is a 3-of-5 council decision - a single cap holder is refused (code 8). Once
revoked, the cap can write no score (code 5), mint no replacement and register no
node. Admin authority is revocable, collectively, and stays revoked.
